<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: IRELAND'S KINGSPAN BUYS SENTRACHEM UK UNIT.</title>
<headline>IRELAND'S KINGSPAN BUYS SENTRACHEM UK UNIT.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Irish building materials firm Kingspan Plc said on Tuesday it was buying British insulation products company Kooltherm from Sentrachem for 9.5 mln stg.</p>
<p>Kingspan said it would pay 6.2 million stg in cash on completion and would discharge a loan from the vendor of 3.3 million stg.</p>
</text>
